# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# SipTail Store — Environment Variables
# Copy this file to .env.local and fill in the values.
# .env.local is git-ignored and never committed.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# REQUIRED: Wix OAuth App Client ID
# How to get / update this:
#   1. Go to manage.wix.com → open the SipTail site
#   2. Settings → Headless Settings → OAuth Apps → SipTail Store Frontend
#   3. Copy the Client ID shown
#   4. After deploying to Vercel, add your Vercel URL as an Allowed Redirect URI
#      in the same OAuth App settings panel.
#
NEXT_PUBLIC_WIX_CLIENT_ID=1d47ce62-8390-4782-86d3-c706cde04ec3
